<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Word is there’s a weird tree on Route\n36. They say it DANCE when you water\fit...\rCrazy, right? It’s prob’ly on\nsomethin’.\rThis a Flower Shop, so we got waterin’\ncans and stuff...\rBut I can’t give you one! Too\ndangerous! You could hurt somebody!\fHmmm...\rWell, maybe if you beat the Goldenrod\nBlock Boss...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Word is there’s a weird tree on Route\n36 that dance when you water it...\rOh! That’s the Plain Chain! You beat\nWHITNEY?! You made her cry?!\rThen you can handle a SquirtBottle.\nBorrow it... Nah, keep it!\fYou earned it, crybaby-slayer!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The weird tree on Route 36.\nBe careful! It might dance at you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lalala lalalala.\nDrink up, my babies! Mama’s here!\fDon’t tell my real kids.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You usin’ the Berry Pots? Plant ’em,\nwater ’em, pick ’em.\rLike raisin’ kids but they don’t talk\nback.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How...\n...\f...\f...\fcute!\rWhere you get that...\noh-so-cute homie?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SHAYMIN, huh?\nIt’s so cute!\rI know!\rLemme give it a flower!\nI got just the one!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Gracidea gon’ look perfect on\nSHAYMIN!\fPut it on SHAYMIN in the daytime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MULCH! WHO WANT MULCH?!\rBerries LOVE Mulch. It make ’em grow\nfast! Don’t ask what’s in it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} is good soil mixed\nwith homie... uh... you know...\rDon’t make me say it.\nIt’s full of nutrients! Allegedly!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks. Come back now!\nWash your hands.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You bought the {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ouch!\nYour Bag full!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0589_T25R0601_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Um... ’scuse me, but you short on\nbread. Mulch ain’t free, baby.</language>
	</row>
</body>
